# The controller database is vendored byte for byte from dish.tinkernorth.com and checked against
# the SHA-256 in its own manifest at every load: a checkout that normalised its line endings would
# ship an app that refuses its bundled copy. Never normalised, never diffed as source.
assets/controllers/** -text
assets/controllers/** linguist-vendored=true
# The future-reader set (a published dbVersion 2 a reader released today must take) is a fixture
# held to its manifest's SHA-256 the same way.
tests/fixtures/controllerdb-future/** -text
